# The app keeping itself current (Updates.kt): a newer build in the local cloud's releases (release-seed: this APK as
# version 0.1.1), found by the core's app.update at the start; settings' version row says 更新到 0.1.1; tapped, it is
# downloaded, checked against its sha256 and handed to the system's installer, which asks the person to confirm.
#only android
#env MBUI_UPDATE_FEED=android
#before release-seed
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:settings
# settings' home pushed in and at rest (a drag while the page still moves in is not the list's), then scrolled to its
# version row (under the fold)
until 此设备
rest
drag 195 700 0 -500 400
until 更新到 0.1.1
shot 1-settings
# the runner asked first to wait for the system's installer in front (the activity manager's top activity), keep its
# page and decline it: once the update is handed over, the installer's page covers the app, which draws no frame till
# it is back in front, so no step of the app's waits through that time
log do: android-installer
tap 更新到 0.1.1
# downloaded and checked (正在安装, before the build is handed over); then the runner's word that the installer came in
# front and was declined (the app in front again), and the app at rest: its update ended (handed to the installer)
until 正在安装
done 1-android-installer
rest
